{"id":388,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"小さな目標を積み重ねる樟蔭の学び","feature_description":"樟蔭中学校は、しっかりした生活習慣と基礎学力を身につけ、「Little Lady」を育てる教育を進めています。コースに応じた学びと、世界レベル・全国レベルのクラブ活動が両立しており、日々の積み重ねで成長できる学校です。放課後のクラブや説明会でも、学校生活の魅力が具体的に伝わります。少人数での実践や、先輩後輩が支え合う雰囲気も印象的です。","clubs":[{"id":7246,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7247,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7248,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7249,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7250,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7251,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7252,"name":"バトントワリング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7253,"name":"ポンポンチア部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7254,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7255,"name":"家庭部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7256,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7257,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shoin-chuko.sakuraweb.com/jhs/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-